/Title (Solving\040optimization\040problems\040using\040black\040hole\040algorithm)
/Author (Masoum\040Farahmandian\054\040Abdolreza\040Hatamlou)
/Subject (Various\040meta\055heuristic\040optimization\040approaches\040have\040been\040recently\040created\040and\040applied\040in\040different\040areas\056\040Many\040of\040these\040approaches\040are\040inspired\040by\040swarm\040behaviors\040in\040the\040nature\056\040This\040paper\040studies\040the\040solving\040optimization\040problems\040using\040Black\040Hole\040Algorithm\040\050BHA\051\040which\040is\040a\040population\055based\040algorithm\056\040Since\040the\040performance\040of\040this\040algorithm\040was\040not\040tested\040in\040mathematical\040functions\054\040we\040have\040studied\040this\040issue\040using\040some\040standard\040functions\056\040The\040results\040of\040the\040BHA\040are\040compared\040with\040the\040results\040of\040GA\040and\040PSO\040algorithms\040which\040indicate\040that\040the\040performance\040of\040BHA\040is\040better\040than\040the\040other\040two\040mentioned\040algorithms\056)
